    "title": "Texas family seeks help after Port Aransas shooting injures 4 relatives - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago A Central Texas family is still reeling after four of their loved ones were injured during a shooting in Port Aransas over the weekend. Several members of the Drayton family remain in Coastal Bend hospitals, and now the family is asking for the public's help as they rally to support their loved ones. To that end, the family, - which is largely from Copperas Cove, located about 70 miles north of Austin - has set up a GoFundMe to help pay for hotel and other expenses as they stay near the hospitals that are treating their family members. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
